oṃ śrīgaṇeśāya namaḥ ||

gurvabhiprāyasamudrāt vividhāni dṛṣṭapratyayāni yogaratnānuciṃtyocintya 
ihānīya yogamālāyāṃ prakāśyante prakaṭīkriyaṃte iti | teṣu prathamaṃ 
vaśyakarmocyate ||

sitabhānuviṭapamūlamiti | sito yo sau bhānuviṭapī arkastasya mūlaṃ maṃjiṣṭhā 
pratītā | bhavana caṭakaṃ gṛha caṭaka śiraḥ kuṣṭhaṃ ebhiścaturbhiroṣadhaiḥ 
ślakṣācūrṇitaiḥ svāṃgakṣata bhavadigdhaiḥ svaśarīraraktamiśritaiḥ 
kṛtāracitā guṭikāḥ khāne pāne datvā tribhuvanamapi vaśīkurvanti 
kimpunarnaramekaṃ || 1||

||śrī|| sitabhānuviṭapamūlaṃ maṃjiṣṭhā bhavana caṭakaṃ kuṣṭhaṃ |
svāṅgakṣata bhavadigdhaistribhuvanamebhirvaśī kurute ||1||

atra śāstre śrīnāgārjunācāryeṇa sarvepi anubhūtā yogā uktā | tālamiti | 
haritālaśma jñāne kṛṣṇacaturdaśyāṃ śavamukhanivasitaṃ kuṣṭhasahitaṃ 
tilakena tribhuvanaṃ vaśaṃyāti || 2 ||

tālaṃ piśāca bhavane bhūtāhni pretavadana paryuṣitaṃ |
rogendra samprayuktaṃ tribhuvana vaśakārakaṃ ||2||

<1b>

mṛtapuruṣa locaneti | mṛtapuruṣasya cakṣuṣī jihvā lalāṭahṛdayaṃ nāsā 
ebhiḥ śmaśānatailapakvaṃ puṣpanakṣatre samastarājapatnīnāṃ vaśakṛt ||3||

mṛtanaralocanalālālalāṭa hṛdghrāṇasādhitaṃ tailaṃ |
sakalabhūbhujendra lalanāvaśāṃkaraṇaṃ karālaye puṣpe ||3||

naratailasritiḥ puruṣavasayāmṛtavastravartikayā puruṣakapāle rātrau 
aśvatthavṛkṣaskandhe dīpaṃ prajvālyakajjalaṃ grāhyaṃ | tenāṃjitamātreṇa yaṃ 
yaṃ paśyati taṃ taṃ vaśayati || 

iti vaśyādhikāraḥ ||

naratailanarakapāle pretāṃvara vartitaḥ kṣapādīpāt |
kṣoṇī hetu mahendraśikhare samutpannaṃ kajjalaṃ jagadvaśakṛt || 4 || 

iti vaśyādhikāraḥ || atha vidveṣaṇaṃ ||

atha vidveṣaṇaṃ | uragāri iti | mayūraśiraḥ kukkuṭaśiraḥ ābhyāṃ dhūpaṃ 
kṛtvā yasya bhavane gṛhe udgrāhyati || taṃ nivāsi jaṃtūnāṃ prītiṃ vināśayati 
|| 5 ||

uragāriśirojanito dhūpavarastāmracūḍaśirasā ca tribhuvanabhavaneṣu gataḥ 
kṣipraṃ prītiṃ vināśayati ||5||

<2a>

ṛtumaddurbhagalalaneti | yā durbhagā nārī tasyā yonau ṛtu divasānyārabhya 
saptadināni śvetasarṣapānprakṣipya anaṃtaramākṛṣṭaiḥ śuktaistaiḥ sarṣapairyo 
yaḥ spṛśyate sa sa vidveṣaṃ yāti ||6||

ṛtumaddurbhagalalanākusumagṛhe saptadināni paryuṣitaiḥ ||
sitasiddhārthaiḥ spṛṣṭastrailokye kona yāti vidveṣaṃ ||6||

dvikaṃdīvasabhīru iti || sādhakottamaiḥ kākolūkapakṣābhyāṃ kṛto dhūpaḥ 
sthāvarajaṃgamajātasya prītiṃ vināśayati kiṃ punargṛhamekaṃ ||7||

pīkadīvasabhīrūpakṣaprabhavo dhūpaḥ prayojitaḥ prītiṃ || hanyānnarendramukhaiḥ 
sa carācara jaṃtu cakrasya ||7||

bhujendrakavaca janmeti | pradhānasarpakaṃcukamayūrapakṣa ābhyāṃ 
samabhāgābhyāṃ kṛtodhūpastrailokyasyāpi vidveṣaṇa kṛt ||8|| 

iti vidveṣaṇaṃ ||

bhujendrakavacajanmābhujaṃgaripupakṣabhāgasaṃyuktaḥ | 
dhūpaḥ prayuktamātre vidveṣakarastrilokasya ||8|| 

iti vidveṣaṇaṃ || athoccāṭanaṃ ||

athoccāṭanaṃ | turagakṣuraraṃdhreti | kṛṣṇasarpaśiraḥ unmatta 
kukkuṭajihvayāsārddhametaddvayaṃ asvakhurāyāste nivāsini chidre kṣiptvā yaysa 
gṛhasya dvāri nikhanyate sa saptabhirdivasairgṛhamuccāṭayati || 

turaṃgakṣuraraṃdhranihitaṃ nāgaśirodakṣajihvayā sahitaṃ | 
bhavanadvāri nikhātaṃ ripumuccāṭayati saptāhāt ||9||

halinīvarāhavarca iti || lāṃgalī śūkaraviṣṭhāmṛtakeśā uṣṭrāsthīni etāni 
catvāri melayitvā yadgṛhadvāri nikhanyate tadgṛhaṃ saptāhāduccāṭayati ||10||

halinī varāhavarcaḥ śavamūrddhajadīrghakaṃ dharāsthīni || 
tribhuvanamapi yogavaraḥ sphuṭamuccāṭayati saptāhāt ||10||

daṇḍakarapuruṣeti | daṃḍakarolaguḍahasto yo'sau puruṣastena codito 
hanyamānastena yavākārabhavaḥ śīghragatī bhūtvā uccarito dīrghakaṃdhra 
uṣṭrastatrārūḍhaṃ evaṃ vidhiṃ puruṣaṃ dhyāyan bṛhaspatimapi 
saptāhāduccāṭayati | kimutasāmānyamātranaramapi ||11||

daṃḍakarapuruṣacodita yavākāra bhavadīrghakaṃ dharārūḍhaṃ | suragurumapi 
saptāhādvicintyoccāṭayet sthānāt ||11||

<3a>

mṛtapuruṣāsthi śaṃkuriti | yasya gṛhapuruṣasya gṛhadvāre puruṣāsthi kīlako 
nikhanyate tasya gṛhaṃ śmaśāna sadṛśaṃ śūnyaṃ bhavatītyarthaḥ ||12|| 

ityuccāṭanaṃ || athadarpaṇe rūpadarśanaṃ ||

mṛtapuruṣāsthi śaṃkurbhavana dvāre nikhanyate yasya |
tasya gṛhaṃ gata vibhavaṃ bhayaṃkarabhūtabhavabhaṃ ||12|| 

ityuccāṭanaṃ atha darpaṇe rūpadarśanaṃ ||

raktahayamāreti | raktakaravīrapuṣpaṃ bhallāṭakaṃ amlavetasaṃ ebhirdarpaṇaṃ 
saṃmārjyasaṃśādhya aśvagarbhakoṣṭra rūpaṃ paśyet ||13||

raktahayamārakta kusumaṃ bhallāṭakamamlavetasamabhīhiḥ |
turagakharadīrghakaṃdhararūpaṃ saṃmārjya darpaṇaṃ paśyet ||13||

hayagocarāhavānareti sukaraṃ ||14|| 

hayagovarāhavānarakharoṣṭraṃ kanakhaiḥ puṭāgninādagdhaiḥ || 
darduravasāmiśraisteṣāṃ rūpāṇi pūrvavat paśyet ||14||

aṃkolatailakajjaleti | aṃkolavṛkṣabījatailena dīpaṃ kṛtvākajjalaṃ gṛhītvā 
gavāṃ ghṛtena āloḍya tena kajjalena dṛṣṭiṃ aṃjayet | 

<3b>

puṣpanakṣatra (* *?)jitanayano janmāṃtare yāni rūpāṃtarāṇyāsan 
tāni darpaṇe paśyati ||15||

aṃkolatailasurabhikṣīrairdṛgaṃjanaṃ puṣpae || 
paśyati darpaṇa madhye rūpāṇi bhavāṃtare (*?) ti ||15||

aṃjitanayaneti | tagaraphalaṃ cūrṇaṃ kṛtvā aṃkolatailenāloḍya cakṣuṣī aṃjayet | 
(*?) yā kṛtiṃ puruṣaṃ paśyati punaḥ kevalanaraphalāṃjanāt prakṛti 
vrajati | divyaṃ puruṣaṃ na paśyatītyarthaḥ ||16||

iti darpaṇe rūpadaśanaṃ ||

aṃjitanayanomanujastagaraphalāṃ kolakalkena |
paśyati puruṣaṃ divyaṃ prakṛtiṃ tagarāṃjanādvrajati ||16||

iti darpaṇe rūpadarśanaṃ ||

atha citrāṃtarddhānamāha | lalanājarāyu dhūpāditi | yoṣidgarbhaśayyā dhūpāt 
bhittisthaṃ citraṃ pratyakṣaṃ praroditi | gugguladhūpācca punarapi citraṃ 
svabhāvasthameva bhavati rodanānnivartate ityarthaḥ ||17||

atha citrāntarddhānamāha | 

lalanājarāyudhūpāccitraṃ bhittau praroditi prakaṭaṃ || 
punarapi purakṛtaṃ dhūpāt sarvaṃ prakṛtiṃ vrajatyāśu ||17||

vṛṣadaṃśikā puraṃdhrīti | mārjārīgarbhaśayyā tathā 
pradhānastrīgarbhaśayyā etābhyāṃ dhūpādbhittisthaṃ citraṃ na dṛśyate | tathā 
suvarṇamahiṣākṣa gugguludhūpena atirohitamapi citraṃ punarapi svabhāvasthamapi 
dṛśyate ||18||

vṛṣadaṃśikāpuraṃdhrīṃ jarāyu dhūpānna dṛśyate bhittau | 
prakṛtitvameti bhūyaḥ kauśika dhūpena dhūpitaṃ citraṃ ||18||

<4a>

karabhakapoleti uṣṭrakapolasvedamūtraśleṣmābhirbahuvāraṃ bhāvitena haritālena 
hastalepāt bhitti gatāni nānāyāti | ālekhyāni sparśādā karṣayati kṣiptameva ||19||

karabhakapolasvedairmūtrakahairbhāvitena tālena ||
tena karagarbhalepāccitrāṇi samākṣipatyāśu ||19||

sarameti | kukkurīgarbhaśayyādhūpena dhūpitaṃ veṣṭitaṃ yat kiṃcit puchādi 
puchamiti kurcikā dinena bhramaṇāmitena savyena dakṣiṇena citravarṇa prabhṛtīni 
haredākarṣayet | vāmato bhramarṇātteṣāṃ hutānāmapi satāṃ mokṣaḥ | 
prakṛtīkaraṇamityarthaḥ ||20|| 

iti citrāntarddhānaṃ samāptaṃ ||

saramājarāyudhūpita veṣṭitapuchādinī haredbhramaṇāṃ |
savyena citravarṇaprabhṛtī na savyato mokṣaḥ ||20||

iti citrāṃtarddhānaṃ ||

atha manuṣyāṃtarddhānaṃ ||

srotaḥ śaśāṃketi | srotāṃjanaṃ sevālakaṃṭakaṃ mākṣikaṃ madhuyaṣṭī 
prathamarajaḥsvalā yāḥ kanyāyāḥ śoṇitaṃ | pratyagralāṃgalī kesarāṇi 
ebhiroṣadhai guṭikāṃ kṛtvā suvarṇaraupyatāmramadhye puruṣasyāṃtarddhānaṃ 
karoti ||21||

sroḥtaḥ śaśāṃkakaṃṭakamadhumadhukaprathamakusumaṃ yuktā |
navahalinīkesarajāgūhati guṭikā trilohagarbhasthā ||21||

nīlāṃśoketi | nīlavarṇāṃśokāṃkura cūrṇaṃ hariṇaraktena saptadhā bhāvitaṃ 
kṛtvā suvarṇaraupyatāmrairāveṣṭyataṃ mukhe kṣiptaṃ sa samasta syāpi 
jagatoṃtarddhānaṃ karoti | kimuta ekasya puruṣasyetyarthaḥ ||22||

nīlāṃśokaprabhavāṃkura cūrṇameṇa raktena saptadhātyaktaṃ |
lohatrayagarbhagataṃ gūhati vaktra sthitaṃ jagadaśeṣaṃ ||22||

tagarasyottareti | somagrahaṇenagnī bhūtvā tasya tagarasyottarādi prasṛtaṃ mūlaṃ 
gṛhītvā trilohaveṣṭitaṃ kṛtvā yo yaḥ pumān mukhe dhārayati sa sa adṛśyo 
bhavati ||23||

tagarasyośaramūlaṃ digvasanenoddhṛtaṃ śaśi grahaṇe |
ravicandravahnimadhyagama dṛśyamānane kṣiptaṃ ||22||

gorocaneti | gorocanādugoravṛkṣapuṣpam udbaṃdhanena mṛtāyā nārī tasyā 
akṣiromāṇikākākhyena pakṣiṇā bhuktaṃ padantaṃ tato anyo ddhṛtaṃ 
tadannādikaṃ etānyoṣadhāni ekatra kṛtvā guṭikākāryā sā mukhe kṣiptā 
puruṣamadṛśye karoti | kalpalalaneti nāmākhyā ||24||

gorocanaṃ guditaru kusumamṛtodbaṃdhitākṣiromāṇi |
dvijabhuktocchiṣṭa yutā guṭikeyaṃ kalpalalanākṣā ||24||

pitṛvaneti | śmaśāne manaḥśilā nārī prathamapuṣpe vahuvelaṃ mardayitvā 
tayā kṛtatilakapuruṣo na dṛśyate ityarthaḥ ||25|| 

pārāvatasyeti | pārāvataḥ kapotaḥ sthūlagrīvāyāṃ kṛṣṇarekhastat kukṣau 
śrotījanāṃjanaṃ kṣiptvā uparimṛttikāṃ datvā citā vaiśvānare pacyate yāvan 
mṛttikā agnivarṇā bhavati tanmadhyācchrotāṃjanaṃ pakvaṃ gṛhītvā tena 
cakṣuṣī aṃjayet |

<5a>

adṛśyo bhavati | kṛṣṇamārjāraraktena cakṣuṣī punarapyaṃjayet mokṣo bhavati 
||26||

pitṛvanamarditamasakṛnnavakanyāreto manaḥśilā yuktaṃ |
tribhuvanamapi vinigūhati tilaka kriyayā lalāṭataṭe ||25||

pārāvatasya kukṣau śrotaścittikā nalena puṭapakvaṃ ||
siddhāṃjanaṃ nigūhati asitabiḍālāśca mokṣanirvāṇaṃ ||26||

navaghaneti | navāni ca tāni ghanāni tṛṇāṃ kuroṇitairuddhṛto mṛt 
navaghanatṛṇāṃkuroddhṛtāmṛt teṣāṃ kila uparisthitā mṛttikā sā madhu 
haritāle etāni trīṇi puṣpanakṣatre melayitvā lalāṭe deśetilaka karaṇāt siddhebhyopi 
nigūhati | kimutānya manuṣyebhyaḥ ||27||

ityadṛśīkaraṇaṃ || atha kutūhalānyucyaṃte | bhramareti | sāreṇa madhyena rahito 
yosau aṃhripodbhavaśaṃkuḥ aṃtaḥsuṣiro yosau 
vṛkṣakīlakojīvadbhrameraparipūrṇagaḥ jīvadbhirbhramaraiḥ samyak paripūritaṃ 
garbhamadhyaṃmuṣirapradeśo yasya sa tathā vidhaḥ śaṃkurākāśe prakṣiptaḥ 
san ākāśeśvavatiṣṭhat lokasya vismararakta adṛṣṭadarśan nirjīvasyākāśe 
kathameva sthānena bhavati ||28||

ityadṛśīkaraṇaṃ | athakautukāni |

navaghanamṛṇāṃkuloddhṛtā mṛnmadhutālamiśritā puṣpe ||
siddhebhyopi nigūhatilalāṭapaṭṭatilakakaraṇena ||29||

bhramaraparipūrṇagarbhastiṣṭhatyākāśamaṇḍale nihitaḥ |
sārarahitāṃ hri podbhavatrāṃkuḥ prakaroti vismayaṃ loke ||28||

<5b>

vidyucchikhidagdhapādapeti | kukkurījarāyunā ādreṇa aśuṣkeṇa marīca pippalī 
śuṇṭhī cūrṇasahitena pralipto yosau śaṃkurvidyuddagdha vṛkṣakīlakaḥ sa 
evaṃvidha ākāśe kṣiptaḥ san ākāśa eva daśāṃgula pramāṇaṃ bahukālaṃ 
yāvadavatiṣṭhata ityarthaḥ ||29||

saramājarāyu nirmiteti kukkurījarāyurbhi śayyā jarākhyā vṛtāhastāṃguli 
mudrikā veṣṭitāyāḥ prabhāvena nirāvalaṃvanaṃ yathā bhavati evamākāśe 
kṣiptaṃ kamalamava tiṣṭhaṃte | tanmudrikā spṛ aṃguli sparśāt 
kamalamākāśānnapataṃtītyarthaḥ ||30||

vidyucchikhidagdhapādapaśaṃkuḥ saramājarāyunārdreṇa |
trikaṭuka yutena liptodaśāṃgulovatiṣṭhati vyomni ||29||

saramājarāyu nirmita pāṇitalaṃ mudrikā prabhāvena |
avalaṃbanaṃ nirapekṣaṃ tiṣṭhatyaṃbhoruhaṃ gagane ||30||

staṃdrākhya bījahometi | staṃdrā āraṇikā muṃḍīti prasiddhā | tasyā bījahomāt 
citāsaṃchādite vareva vahnau agnau ātārka darśanākāśe caṃdrātapa jyotsnā 
yāmeva kāryaṃ kiṃ bhavaṃtyanenetyāha dṛśyaṃte | śūlapāṇayo rudrāḥ evaṃ 
kṛte triśūladharā īśvara mūrtayo dṛśyaṃte ||31||

kurusa iti | kuru niṣpādaya samidasāradāruṇi samidbhūte asārakāṣṭhe gaṃdhakāṃ 
kulatailābhyāṃ pralipte mṛkṣite taptena ghṛtasuta havanāt || tadāṃ cayat 
ghṛtaṃ ājyaṃ pādaṃ tayorhavanāt vaiśvā narasya prajvalanaṃ bhavati ||32||

<6a>

staṃdrākhya bījahomāccitānasaṃchādivare vahnau || 
caṃdrātape vilagnād dṛśyaṃte śūlapāṇayo rudrāḥ ||31||

kurusamidasāradāruṇi gaṃdhākhyāṃ kuru tailasaṃlipte | 
tadā ghṛtasutasūtahavanāt prajvalanaṃ bhavati dahanasya ||32||

evaṃ vidheṃ dhaneti | pūrvokta āryāyāṃ | asārasāruṇi gaṃdhasyāṃ kula taila 
saṃlipte evaṃ vidheṃ dhanasthe gaṃdhakacūrṇaṃ prakṣiptaṃ kiṃ karotītyāha | 
tadā ghṛta kṣepāt śīghramagniṃ prajvālayati ||33|| 

kalmāvikā vimardita vajreti | kalmākhikā aṃgārikāstābhi deva kṛtaṃ 
pūrvasadṛśamiṃdhanaṃ | anaṃtaraṃ pūrvayogavat | 
samidasāradāruṇigaṃdhāssākullatailasaṃlipte iṃdhane tasmin jala havanāt pānīya 
homāt jvalati nitāṃtaṃ niśeṣaṃ utpādito vai dyuto'gnirjvalati ||34||

evaṃ vidheṃdhanasthe gaṃdhakapāṣāṇasaṃbhavoseṇuḥ || 
taptāhyahutihomāt prāgiti prajvālayatya nalaṃ ||33||

kalmākhikā vimardita vajrānaladagdhe raṇye ||
jvalati nitāṃtaṃ janito jalahavanādvaidyuto vahniḥ ||34||

ṛtumahyeti | ṛtumatī cāsau lalanā ca tasthāḥ kusuma gṛhe yonau saptadināni 
vāsitaṃ uṣitai sthāpitaṃ kramāt siddhaṃ | guru paraṃparayā siddhaṃ prakaṭayati | 
vahni madhye darśayati | aṃgāramadhye hutaṃ sau vīrāṃjanaṃ puruṣaṃ darśayati | 
agnikuṃḍa madhye evaṃ vidhe sau vīrāṃjane havanāt puruṣa rūpaṃ dṛśyate ||
35||

iti kutūhalādhikāraḥ || athāgni staṃbhaḥ || śaśīti | śaśijaṃ sevālaṃ 
jalaukādardurau jīvaviśeṣau || pāṭalāyā vṛkṣaviśeṣamūlāni 
ebhiroṣadhaistailaṃ paripakvaṃ tena caraṇatala lepādaṃgāra khanikā madhye 
yatheṣṭaṃ paribhrāmyate aṃgāraparipūrṇagarbhamadhye sādhako bhramatītyarthaḥ 
||36||

ṛtumallalanāsaptāhakusuma gṛhe vāsitaṃ kramāt siddhaṃ ||
prakaṭayati vahni madhye havanāt sauvīrakaṃ puruṣaṃ ||35||

śaśijalaukādardura tailairebhiḥ sa pāṭalā mūlaiḥ ||
caraṇatalasaṃpralepāddhamati narāṃgāra khānikā madhye ||36||

bheketi | maṃḍukavasāmadhye vo muditaṃ jalaukā ca sevālaṃ ca prakṣipya 
caraṇādikaṃ pralipyate tatogne rupari bhramato na dāha sphoṭādikaṃ na bhavati | 
himaśītalo vahnirbhavatītyarthaḥ ||37||

dhaveti | dhavalamaṃḍūkacūrṇaṃ maṃḍūkarudhireṇa bahuśo bhāvitaṃ kṛtvā 
agnau kṣipyatena agniḥ staṃbhitaḥ śatavarṣaśatairapi āharapākaṃ na karoti ||38||

bhekavasā śrāvaṇikayājaraloka sa caṃdra saṃbhavairyuktā ||
caraṇatala saṃpralepāt karoti himaśītalaṃ vahniṃ ||39||

dhavalahma(?)vaṃgamodbhavareṇuṃ rudhireṇa raṃjayet tasya ||
na pacati varṣaśatairapi vibhāvasuḥ stambhitastena ||38||

turageti | aśvapādatararaṃdhramadhye māsatrayaṃ yāvat prakṣiptairagniruddīpitopi 
sa ca romamātramapi dagdhuṃ samartho bhavati ||39||

ityagni staṃbhādhikāraḥ || atha jalastaṃbhanaṃ ||

prakṣipyeti | ḍiḍubhodvimukhaiḥ sarpastasya rakta kutracit paṭāṃtare kṛtvā 
mukhamadhye prakṣipyate pānīya madhye gataḥ san strīya gṛhamadhye iva sukhena 
tiṣṭhati | jalena plāvyate jalastaṃbhanaṃ bhavatītyarthaḥ ||40||

turagakṣuraraṃdhranihitairnaḍavetasamulamākhayavabhekaiḥ | 
na dahati sa caro mamapi staṃbhinaretaiḥ pradīpitopya nalaḥ ||39||

prakṣipya madana madhye ḍiḍubhara praviśya jalamadhye | 
nijabhavanābhyaṃtara iva tiṣṭhedātmechayā dhīmān ||40||

śyoneti | aralavṛkṣabījaiḥ pādukā dvayaṃ pūryati māruhya bhūmāviva pānīyo 
pariprakaṭaṃ yathā bhavatyevaṃ sa carati ||41||

naveti | navanīta suvarṇa gairike prasiddhe | durgaṃdhā auṣadhi viśeṣaḥ | matsya 
tailaṃ eteṣāṃ cūrṇena śarīrasaktāni sarvāṇi srotāṃsi raṃdhrāṇi abhyajyatenato 
matsya iva jalopari bhramati ||42||

śyonākabīja cūrṇaṃ kṛtvā cākramya pādukā yugalaṃ ||
mahyāmiva salilopari paryaṭati naraḥ suvispaṭaṃṣṭaṃ ||41||

navanītarukmagairikadurgaṃdhā mīnatailakalkena |
sakalaśrotatobhyaṃgādbhramati naronakra vatsalile ||42||

bhogeti | bilvaṃ madanaphalaṃ etau kṣīreṇa mardayitvā guṭikāṃ kṛtvā 
gośṛṃga madhya sthita suṣira pradeśe prakṣipya saptadināni yāvat tatratāṃ 
dhārayitvā paścāt tataḥ ākṛṣyapāna pātraraṃdhreṣu nāvādi dviraṃdhreṣu 
kṣiptvā guṭikānāvādi staṃbhayati | nāvādi staṃbhanaṃ bhujala staṃbhanaṃ 
bhavati | atonena yogena jalaṃ stambhyate ato jalastaṃbhanāt nāvāvādīnāṃ 
staṃbhanamucitaṃ ||43||

iti jalastaṃbhanādhikāraḥ |

atha piśācīkaraṇamāha | jīveti | dhattūra bījacūrṇaṃ śuṣkakāṣṭhāṃtaravārī 
kṛmi ghunastasya cūrṇaṃ nīlosthūlāmachikā kokilāstāsāṃ cūrṇa 
etānyoṣadhāyi ekatra kṛtvā pāne dattāni piśācaṃ kurvati | graha gṛhītamiva 
kurvaṃtītyarthaḥ | tathā etaddoṣme guḍenakāṃjikamiśreṇa pītenopaśāmyati | 
etadoṣadhapānāt punarapi saṃsukhaṃ svastho bhavati ||44||

gogavaraṃdhranihitaiḥ śrīphalakā hrīyaiḥ payaḥ piṣṭaiḥ | 
staṃbhayati yāna pātraṃ sarvāṃtaraṃdhragā guṭikā ||43||

jīvānikāṃcanataroghūrṇa cūrṇayutāni kokilābhiśca ||
kurvaṃti naraṃ pretakyā nayaśaṃguḍālanālābhyāṃ ||44||

dvijeti | brāhmaṇaviḍālavānaracāṃḍāla ulūkanakula eteṣāṃ romāṇi 
viḍālaviṣṭayā sahacūrṇitāni khāne pāne pradattāni unmādaṃ utpādayaṃti | 
viramo virāla catuścaye ||45||

gometi | sṛgālapucchaṃ kākaṃ pakṣiṇo dakṣiṇa vibhāga sthitaṃ pichaṃ dvayaṃ 
melayitvā yasya śayane nyasyate sa ca raudreṇāpasmāreṇa gṛhyate ||46||

dvijamārjārakapiśvapacakākari nakularomāṇi ||
piṣṭāniviramavaccairukmadakaraṇṭhe sarvalokānāṃ ||45||

gomāyorjāṃgulaṃ dvijadakṣiṇapakṣabhāga yuktaṃ |
śayananyastaṃ visṛjati ghoraṃ śatrorapasmāraṃ ||46||

kaneti | dhattūrakaharitālabījapūrakāni kapotaviṣṭhā mayūraviṣṭhā 
kukkurāviṣṭhā etānyopadhāni ekatra cūrṇayitvā yasya khāne dīyate śirasivā 
cūrṇaṃ vā prakṣipyate sa unmādena gṛhyate | unmatto bhavatītyarthaḥ | 
śiromuṃḍanenasu narapi vimado bhavataḥ yadā śirasi sthitāḥ keśāmuṃḍāyaṃte 
| tadā satprakṛtistho bhavati ||47||

iti piśācī(?)karaṇādhikāraḥ ||

romaśāttanamāha | hālāhaleti | kṛṣṇasarpapucchaṃ saptadināni yāvat dhattūra 

<8a>

tailamadhye parivasitaṃ san romakeśādikaṃ śātayati | anaina tailābhyaktaṃ 
romakeśādikaṃ svayameva patati | ata eva pradhānaṃ romaśātanametat ||48||

kanakālamātuluṃgaijyārāvatakekitāmracūḍānāṃ ||
sakṛdunmattaṃ kurute vimadokeśīti karaṇā bhavati ||47||

hālāhalalāṃśū(?)laṃ saptadinakanaka taile paryuṣitaiḥ ||
śātayati keśanihataṃ tathyamidaṃ keśaśātanaṃvaraṃ ||48||

bahuśa iti | bahūn vārāntho haridugdhena tilān bhāvayitvā tatastailaṃ gṛhītvā 
tena tailena keśā abhyaṃjyate keśāḥ śvetavarṇā bhavaṃti | paraṃ 
śarīrasyāṃbhyaṃgona kāryaḥ | patestailaṃ telena śarīraṃ pāṃḍaraṃ bhavati | sa 
kuṣṭhaṃ pratibhāsatetyarthaḥ ||49||

aṣṭeti | sudhā prasiddhā tasyā bhāga (1) haritāla bhāga (1) ekatra jalena melayitvā 
vaiśvānareṇāyo deyaḥ paścāt tena svāṃgaśītalena keśajālamabhyajyate 
keśajālaṃ na paśyati || 

anena vidhinā haritāla prayuktā sudhā satyaṃ keśasamūhaṃ pātayati | etat sa 
carācara loke prasiddhamityarthaḥ ||50||

vahuśo vajrīpayasā bhāvita tilatailamūrddhajābhyaṃgāt ||
dhavalaparāhakarucayo bhavaṃti keśā nityaṃgāt ||49||

aṣṭamabhāgayutāsudhājalenānalena saṃtaptā ||
jñātayati keśajālaṃ yuktā sa carācare jagati ||50||

saiṃdhava haritāletyādi sugamaṃ ||51|| 

iti lomaśātanādhikāraḥ || atha śastra staṃbhaḥ || prakṣipyeti ||

<8b>

ahaṃsāsarapuṃkhā tasyā uttarādigbhavaṃ mūlaṃ vadane kṣiptaṃ yāvat kenāpi 
sahanavadati maunenāpi tiṣṭhate tāvat tasya śarīre prahāro nalagati ||52||

divaseti | āditya grahaṇe kṛṣṇacaturdaśyāṃ vā ādityavāre puṣpanakṣatre 
pāṭalāmutpādya mukhe vidhṛtaṃ sakhaḍgaṃ stambhayati | khaḍgādi ghātaḥ 
śarīre nalagatītyarthaḥ || pāṭalāpuṣpajātīyo vṛkṣaviśeṣaḥ ||53||

saindhava haritālasudhāyavanālarasaṃyutāyogaḥ |
kurute romavihīnaṃ prayuktamātrastrilokamapi ||51||

prakṣipya vadanamadhye mūlamahiṃsottaraṃ sadāsamare ||
nabhiṃdatiśaṃstramaṃgaṃbhūllīsaṃtiṣṭhate yāvat ||52||

divakara grahaṇe sitabhūtāhni prāpyapāṭalā mūlaṃ ||
ravivāre puṣpadine vadana gataṃ khaḍgavāraṃ kurute ||53||

parṇyeti | anena divasakara grahaṇādinā pūrvokta vidhinā śālīparṇī auṣadhaṃ 
mūlaṃ utavātaṃ mukhe kṣiptaṃ saṃgrāmamadhye ghoraṇī varṣaṃ nipataṃ taṃ 
nivārayati | saṃgrāmamadhye śarāḥ śarīraṃ nabhiṃdaṃtītyarthaḥ | na kevalaṃ 
pūrvaprāptā | pāṭalāśaraṃ varṣaṃtaṃ nivārayati | yāvat parṇyavīśālaparṇyapi 
śabdārthaḥ ||54|| 

savitariśastra staṃbheti | trīn divasān yāvadupavāsān kṛtvā māghatrayodaśyāṃ 
astaṃ gachati | āditye maṃtra rakṣādikaṃ aśvagaṃdhāpītāsati śastra staṃbhaṃ 
karoti ||55|| 

iti śastrastambhādhikāraḥ ||

parṇyapyanena vidhinā samāhṛta vadanamadhye nikṣiptā | 
samaraśaranikaravarṣaṃ nipataṃ taṃ vārayatyāśu ||54||

savitari śastra pramailaṃ(?) bamāne karoti huyagaṃdhā ||
tridinoṣitena pītā vidhivat ||

<9a>

māghatrayodaśyāṃ ||55||

atha diśāṃtara gamanaṃ || sitabhṛṃgeti | śvetabhṛṃgarāja śvetakokilākṣaḥ 
śvetakākajaṃghā śvetaśarapuṃkhāyāḥ mūlaṃ hrī bījaṃ bālakabījaṃ 
ebhiroṣadhaiḥ kaṭyāṃbaddhairvāyurivabhūmiṃ bhramati yathā vāyuḥ 
pathagamanaḥ | evaṃ sopi kaṭitaṭabaddhairoṣadhairbhramatītyarthaḥ | sitaśabdaḥ 
sanivartayitvā pādaṃ dvayaṃ lepanīyaṃ amarahitodinaikena yojanaśataṃ gachati ||
57||

sitabhṛṃge kokile kṣaṇajaṃghā puṃkhāśi phābhirhrī bījaiḥ ||
kaṭitaṭavaddhairebhiḥ samīravanmedinīṃ bhramati ||56||

madanaphalaṃ sitajaṃghākṣīraṃ surabhestathaika varṇāyāḥ ||
bhūrjatva kuca teṣāṃ pādayorlepācchataṃ gachet ||57||

kṛketi | kṛkalāsatprasiddhaḥ raktamāla ulūkastayoḥ kaṃkālāni aśvīni surendra 
gopakṛmi viśeṣaḥ mayūrarudhiraṃ ebhiroṣadhaiḥ kṛtvā guṭikāsuvarṇa 
madhye nikṣiptā satī mukhe kṣiptā pratyahaṃ yojanāni trīṇi śatāni sārdhāni 
sādhakaḥ prayāti amarahitaḥ ||58||

śiteti | śuklavaṃśalocanāṃ āhako bhṛṃgārastasya mūlāni 
patairoṣadhaiścūrṇitaiḥ puṣpanakṣatre chāgalī navanītena pācitaiḥ caraṇatala 
pralepādyathepsitaṃ yathātaṃ pratidinaṃ sādhako gachati | etallepa prabhāvo na 
vāṃchitāni yojanāni sādhakoprajatītyarthaḥ ||59||

iti dūradeśāṃtaragamanaṃ ||

atha grahaṇadarśanaṃ ||

<9b>

aṃkuleti | aṃkulabījatailaṃ mayūrapittaṃ bhallāṭakabījaṃ etāni trīṇi melayitvā 
darpaṇa talaṃ lepayet | akāle eva sūryagrahaṇaṃ loke dṛśyate | ravi viṣaye 
darpaṇatale vilipyate yacchikhaṃḍi pittena tato yojanāṃtare sthite loka āditya 
grahaṇaṃ paśyati | kimutanikaṭasta anena yogasāmarthyaṃ darśayati divāya ||60||

muni vṛkṣeti | munīnāṃ vṛkṣo muni vṛkṣaḥ palāśastasya puṣpāṇi teṣāṃ 
salilaṃ rasaḥ śrotāṃjanaṃ prasiddhaṃ rasāṃjanamityeke | śrotāṃjanaṃ 
cūrṇakṛtyapalāśapuṣparasena cakṣuṣī aṃjayet | vegena divase ekanakṣatra 
samūhaṃ paśyati ||61||

aṃkulatailayuktaṃ śikhiyittāruṣkaraṃ tathā bījaṃ ||
ebhirdarpaṇa lepādgrahaṇaṃ syād darśanaṃ bhānoḥ ||60||

munivṛkṣakusumarasaiḥ śrotāṃjanaṃ cūrṇanirmitaṃ puṣpe || 
darśayati divāyato nakṣatra gaṇaṃ dṛgaṃjanaṃ puṣpe ||61||

dīpaketi | prathamatastu bahuśolākṣārase bhāvitāṃ mūlavartikāṃ kṛtvā 
karaṃjatailena atyarthaṃtāṃ varti punarbhāvayitvā tayā vartyā dīpaṃ prajvālya 
vistīrṇa mukhabhāṇḍamadhye prakṣipya pradīpamupari bhāṃḍamukhaṃ 
vānaraścarmaṇāpidhāya pradhānaṃ niraṃdhraṃ tadbhāṃḍamaṃbhasi yāvat 
matitāvat pramāṇaṃ caṃdaragrahaṇaṃ bhavatīti ||62||

iti sūryacandragahaṇādhikāraḥ ||

atha veśāvidhānaṃ || śaveti | mṛtakakalevarasyāsye kṛṣṇacaturdaśyāṃ 
guggulu kṣiptaṃ punarmukhamadhyādā kṛṣyanītaṃcitāgninā dīpitaṃ sakalaṃ 
jagadapitaṃ sakalajagadapi dhūpena āveśayati | kiṃ punarekaṃ satyarthaḥ ||64||

<10a>

dīpakamalakuvavartyākaraṃjataila pradigdhayā kṛtvā | haricarmaṇāpihitaṃ 
viśālamukhaṃ bhāṇḍamadhyasthaṃ ||62||

tadvanagataṃ ca tadvaccandra jyotsnā viśeṣa iti | payasimajjaṃti yāvat tāva 
grahaṇaṃ bhavediṃdoḥ ||63||

śavavadanakuharasaṃsthaṃ citāgninādīpi puraṃ kṛṣṇo || 
bhūtāhni jagadaśeṣaṃ dhūpādāveśayatyāśu ||64||

kanakāleti | dhattūraphalabījaṃ haritālaṃ tribhuvanavijayā citrakaḥ 
ugragaṃdhākukkuṭāṃ (*?) khaṃḍāni eteṣāmauṣadhānāṃmeliśritānāṃ 
dhūpāt sacarācaraṃ lokamāveśayaṃti | anena dhūpena sa carācarasya lokasya 
āveśo bhavati ||65||

mahiṣeti | paṃcāṃgadhattūracūrṇaṃ māhiṣarudhireṇa sa bahuśo bhāvayitvā 
śuṣkaṃ ṣoḍaśasamabhāgaṃ vatsa nāgaviṣayuktaṃ rātrau tasya dhūpāt 
puruṣāṇāṃ ceṣṭāṃ haraṃti ||66||

ityāveśādhikāraḥ ||

kanakālamātulāni citravacākukkuṭāṇḍaśakalāni | 
āveśayaṃti dhūpāt svasthaṃ sa carācaraṃ loke ||65||

mahiṣarudhirapradigdhaḥ paṃcāṃgaḥ ṣoḍaśāṃśa viṣayuktaḥ |
kanakaviṭapī ca dhūpādrātrau ceṣṭā haraḥ puṃsāṃ ||66||

atha viṣaprayogavidhānaṃ | siteti | śvetakaravīramūlaṃ arkavṛkṣakīṭakaḥ 
vṛścikakaṃṭakavatsanāgaviṣaṃ etānyoṣadhāni jalena piṣṭvā hastanalikāṃ 
lepyayaḥ spṛśyate sagoana sadaṣṭavadbhavati | sarpadaṣṭa iva pratibhāsate | 
tasyāṃgaṃ kṣaṇena haṃtītyarthaḥ || karagonāsa eva ||67|| 

kanaketi | kapiraktaromāṇi citrakūṭakhaḍikā etad dvayaṃ cūrṇayitvā saptadināni 
yāvadarka dugdhena bhāvayitvā punarapi paṭikāsakala rūpāguṭikā kriyate tayā 

<10b>

guṭikayā pṛthivyāstalessarpa rūpaṃ likhitvā yaḥ spṛśati sa sarpa daṣṭa iva 
pratibhāsate tābhyāṃ khaṭikāvānarībhyāmityarthaḥ || 

iti viṣaprayogādhikāraḥ ||

sitaturagamāramūlaṃravitaṃtu śarabhaśca vṛścikasyā āralaṃ |
viṣmrātabhāgayutairedhiḥ karogonaso bhavati ||67||

kanakadugdhābhyaktā saptadinaṃ vānarī tayā ṣaṭikā ||
likhi spṛṣṭo viṣadastābhyāṃ bhuvibhogīnaḥ ||68||

atha viṣāprahāraṃ || malayeti | caṃdananāgakeśaraṃ prasiddhaṃ || madanaphalaṃ 
kuṣṭaṃ tagaraṃ ca etānyoṣadhāni ekatra kṛtvā saṃcūrṇya taṃdūlā kena 
piṣṭvā madhyaṃbhyaṃtaḥ pibe vāhye daṃśe ca lepaṃ dadyāt nānāprakāraṃ 
sthāvaraṃ jaṃgamaṃ kṛttrimaṃ viṣaṃ sarvamapi nāśayati | na kevalaṃ 
pūrvoktairyogairutpāditaṃ kṛtrimameva prayātītyarthaḥ ||69||

tadiveti | tasminnevadine yaḥ samutpanno vatsakastasya viṣṭā tagaraṃ 
nāgakaṃṭakaṃ ābhyāṃ guṭikāṃ kṛtvā paścādyatheṣṭaṃ viṣaṃ bhakṣayet | 
viṣasya doṣo na prabhavati | śūlapāṇiriva yathā purāmathanārebhe 
yatheṣṭamīśvareṇa kālakūṭaṃ bhakṣitaṃ tathā asāvapi bhakṣayana paraṃ na kopi 
doṣadaḥ syāt ||70||

malayabhavanāgakesaramadanaphalavyādhi tagarasaṃyuktaḥ ||
kṣapayati viṣaṃ vicitraṃ taṃdūlatoyena saṃyutohyagadaḥ ||69||

taddivasājjātavatsakavarcobhistagaraguṭikāsusaṃbhakṣya yathākāmaṃ viṣaṃ 
pibessūlapāṇeriva ||70||

bheketi | maṃḍukavasādvimukhasarpavasākaṭukādī vṛkṣaphalāni ekatra piṣṭvā 
hastatalaṃ vilipya tena hastatalasaṃsparśācca sarvāṇi viṣāṇi daśādapi prayāṃti ||
71||

<11a>

goghṛteti | surabhī ghṛtaṃ ṣoharidugdhaṃ mayūraraktaṃ 
dvimukhasarpamāṃsakhaṇḍāni dvimukhasarpāsthi khaṃḍāni etāni vāṭayitvā 
praliptaṃ yattūraṃ paṭahaṃ ḍamarukādikaṃ tasya yosau nādasthat prabhāvena 
tribhuvanamapi nirviṣaṃ bhavati | yayaḍādaṃdaḥ patati tadā 
etairoṣadhairḍamarukapuṭāni vilipya paścāt ḍamaruḍaṃkasyāgraṃ vādyate 
viṣanigraho bhavatītyarthaḥ ||72||

iti viṣāpahāraḥ ||

bheka dvimukhā hi vasākaṭukī śleśmāṃta pādapaphalāni ||
ebhirvilipyapāṇiḥ sparśādaṃśādviṣaṃ harati ||71||

goghṛtavajrivarhikṣataja dvimukhāhi piśita kaṃkālaiḥ |
praviliptasuranādastribhuvanamapi nirviṣaṃ kurute ||72||

atha viṣamajvarāpahāraḥ ||

nagnādīti | caturdaśī divase praharadvaya samaye keśānmuktalā kṛtvā nagnī 
bhūtvā śikhāyāṃ rakṣāgraṃthi vaddhā aṃgarakṣāṃ kṛtvā aṣṭaudikpālā 
nāhūya pūjayitvā auṣadhīmabhimaṃtrya dhūpapuṣpacaṃdanādi 
vidhānādgṛhatamasitehni vālamūlaṃ tasya saptaśakalāni saptakhaṃḍāni 
kṛtvā haridrādi raṃjita sūtre vaddhvā paścājjvariṇāṃ haste baddhvāni 
cāturthikaṃ jvaraṃ kṣapayaṃti dūrī kurvaṃti athavā pūrvavat jigināmūlaṃ 
gṛhītaṃ takreṇa pītaṃ cāturthikaṃ jvaraṃ mahāraudramapi nāśayati ||73||

iti viṣamajvaropahāraḥ || atha bhūtagrahādiśātanamāha ||

nagnādi vidhi samāhṛta vālasya saptaśakalāni ||
kṣapayaṃti bhūte divase cāturthikaṃ pāṇi baddhāni ||73||

11b>

oṃmiti | oṃkāracakra hūṃ phaṭ amuṃmaṃtraṃ sādhakasya dakṣiṇahaste 
kuṃkumādi surabhi dravyairlikhitaṃ yadā grahagṛhītaḥ paśyati tadā graho 
naśyati | ayaṃ maṃtro ḍāmara iti bhāṇitvā prasiddhaḥ | bhūtānāṃ 
yakṣarākṣasaśākinyādīnāṃ ḍamaraḥ aṃtakaraḥ satyaṃ nyepi vahavo maṃtrāḥ 
pṛthivyāṃ vratopavāsaṃ maṃtrajapapūjā dhyānādibhirbahubhiḥ kaṣṭa 
paraṃparābhiḥ sāghitāḥ sakalā bhavaṃti | ayaṃ dṛṣṭamātra evagrahamokṣādi 
kāryaṃ karoti | prastāvāccalalūkasya dakṣiṇapadaṃ pakṣaṃ śvetasūtreṇa 
veṣṭayed dakṣiṇaṃ pūrvavaditi ||74||

oṃkāracakra huṃ phaṭ nyāsena hasta vinyastaḥ grahamokṣaṇaṃ kurute maṃtroyaṃ 
bhūtaḍāmaraḥ prasiddhaḥ ||74||

gogeti gośṛṃgaṃ viḍālaviṣṭhā hastinakhaṃ sarvakaṃcukaṃ mayūrapakṣāṇi 
śatapuṣpolasunahiṃgu etānyekatra melayitvā grahagṛhītāyate grahagrastaṃ 
vimuktā praṇaśyati | bhujagavalla ityanye tanmate sarpagarala yogamadhye kṣipyate 
grahākraṃdaṃti | chinatti || iti grahaketurgrahapakṣa sa ḍākinī prabhṛtīnāṃ 
nāśayati ityarthaḥ | durgaṃdhā śatapuṣpaṃ || 

iti viṣamahṛtagrahamokṣaṇādhikāraḥ ||

yogavalaviḍālaśakṛtkarikakaruhabhujaga kavaca śikhi candraiḥ ||
grahaketurayaṃ dhūpo durgaṃdhālaśuna hiṃgubhiryuktaḥ ||74||

atha jyotirdarśanaṃ ||

dharaṇīti | bhūnāgaśarīraṃ manaḥśilā haritāla etāni trīṇi cūrṇayitvā 

<12a>

sarṣapatailena sahaśarīrābhyaṃgaḥ kāryaḥ sādhakaḥ rātrau dīptaṃ 
jvalaṃtamivasādhakaśārīramanyalokairdṛśyate ||76||

khadyoteti | khadyotaśakragopako jīvaviśeṣaḥ āmalakī phalabījatailaṃ śaranabījaṃ 
tailaṃ etābhyāṃ tailābhyāṃ madhye khadyotaka indragopakīṭakaḥ | śoṣayitvā 
sūkṣmacūrṇaṃ kṛtvā pralipyayat kiṃcidvigrahādikaṃ dehādikaṃ lipyate 
tatrādau dīptajvaladiva dṛśyate ||77||

iti jyotirdarśanādhikāraḥ ||

dharaṇīlatāśilālaiḥ sarṣapatailena marditaḥ kalkaḥ ||
rajativahāṃdhakāren vigrahaṃ jvālayatyepaḥ ||76||

khadyotaśakragopadhātrīśaṇabījatailakalkena |
prajvalati vigrahāghaṃ rātraumallipyate kiṃcit ||77||

athāṃjanavidhiḥ ||

mṛgeti | sṛgālalocane cūrṇī kṛtya pānīṃ yena gharṣayitvā kramaśo guṭike 
dve vaddhvā punaḥ kramāt śṛgāladakṣiṇākṣṇā svadakṣiṇākṣivāmena 
vāmākṣi etābhyāṃ aṃjita netraḥ sādhakaḥ rātrau bahūnibhūtāni 
yakṣarākṣasādīni paśyati | tasmai sādhakāya yakṣādi paśyate | yakṣādīni 
prayachaṃti siddhadravyāṇi aṃjanapaṭukā aṃtarddhāne ākāśagāmītyādīni ||78||

mṛgadhūrtalocanayoścūrṇenāṃjitanayana yugaḥ kramāt ||
paśyati prabhūtāni rātrau siddhadravyaṃ prayachaṃti ||78||

paṭaheti | paṭahovāṭya viśeṣaḥ svapradīpagarbhaḥ pradīpomadhyagarbhe yasya sa 
tathā taṃtutareṇāti sūkṣmeṇa yattalena 

<12b>

vānaracarmaṇā kṛtamācchādane yasya sa tathā evaṃ vidhaḥ paṭaho rātrau 
gṛhamadhye sthāpita candraprabhāṃ viśeṣayati | ādhikyena karotītyarthaḥ ||79||

gokṣīreti | godugdhaṃ atibalaḥ kākahī prasiddhāmadhuyaṣṭī goghṛtaṃ valābala 
evaśarkarāmatsyaṃtrī etānyoṣadhāni cūrṇayitvā ||

paṭahā pradīpagarbhastanutaraharicarmaṇā kṛtachannaḥ gṛhamadhyagaḥ 
kṣapāyāṃ candrajyotsnāṃ viśeṣayati ||79||

gokṣīrāti balāyaṣṭi ghṛtaṃ balāśarkarā vartakāle ||

avalehaṃkārayet | kratu kāle vaṃdhyāpi lokeśvaraṃ putraṃ labhate | 
lokānīśvaraṃ lokeśvaraṃ mahārājānamityarthaḥ | anena kṛtena vandhyāpi 
garbhaṃ dhārayati | kiṃ punaraparānānītyarthaḥ ||80||

aśvattheti | revatī nakṣatre pippalasṛkṣādivaṃdakā vṛkṣakhaṃḍaṃ gṛhītvā 
revatī nakṣatre vaṃdhyā nārī haste sūtre vaṃdho vaṃdhyā garbhaṃ dhārayati | 
vṛkṣopari yosau vṛkṣaḥ anyaḥ utpadyate savaṃdākaḥ ||81||

avalihyasamprasūte kanyālokeśvaraṃ putraṃ ||80||

aśvatthataru tvak samudbhavaṃdākaṃ saṃpragṛhya revatyāṃ ||
vadhyerna tena pāṇau vaṃdhyā garbhaṃ pragṛhṇāti ||81||

vyāghreti | vyāghraraktaṃ vyāghramāṃse khaṃḍāni bhramaro dadhi dugdha 
vikāraḥ | utpalāni kusumaviśeṣaḥ etāni cūrṇayitvā jalenāloḍya sadā dināni yāvat 
kuṃḍa madhye sthāpyaṃte saptame divase ṣaṇmāsajīvitaṃ vyāghra yugmaṃ 
utpadyate ||82||

<13a>

manuṣyeti manuṣya strīpuruṣayugalaṃ tayormalaṃ śarīrādeḥ samutpannaṃ tathā 
tayoḥ rudhiraṃ tathā tayoriṃdriyaṃ śukraṃ tathā tayoḥ karṇamalaṃ tathā 
tayorakṣaṇermalaṃ etānyoṣadhāni nārīdugdhena mardayitvā ekaviṃśati dināni 
yāvadvṛka carmaṇā veṣṭayitvā muṃcate ekaviṃśati divaiḥ puruṣanārī yugaṃ 
tanmadhyādutpadyate ||83||

vyāghrakṣata bhavapiśitairbhramarairdadhyutyalānite kuṇḍe 
ṣaṇmāsaprāṇadhāraṃ saptāḍhā vyāghramithunaṃ ||82||

manuṣyamalarudhireṃdriyakarṇakṣi matyaṃ pramathya tatpayasā || 
sāhuḍakṛttivṛttairebhirnaramithunaṃ syāt trisaptāhāt ||83||

lalaneti | agre prathamaneva suratāt pūrvamevanārīṇāṃ kaṭitaṭe vaddhaṃ 
dhattūrakamūlaṃ garbhaṃ nivārayati tathā surataviśevaṇakāle baddhaṃ tat 
etanmūlaṃ sa puṣpakaṃ garbhaṃ nivārayati | ṛtukālepi vaddhaṃ kaṭi taṭe 
nārīṇāṃ garbhaṃ nivārayatītyarthaḥ ||84||

saṃbhajyeti | ārtave yathākāle purāṇaghṛtamātramārtave cāpi | aniśaṃsu 
purāṇaṃ jīrṇaṃ goghṛtaṃ saṃbhakṣya sama (*?) bruṣītvā atiśayena 
surata satkvāpi nārī garbhena gṛhṇāti | rātrīvārasaṃkāmasevātatparāpi nārī 
jīrṇagoghṛtapānād tu kāle garbhaṃ na gṛhṇātītyarthaḥ ||85||

lalanānitamba baddhaṃ mātulamūlaṃ nivārayatyagraṃ |
nityaṃ surataniṣevaṇakāle garbhaṃ sa puṣpakaṃ dṛṣṭaṃ ||84||

saṃbhakṣya kāle purāṇaghṛtamātramārtave cāpi |
aniśaṃ suratasaktārāmāgarbhaṃ nigṛhṇaṃti ||84||

<13b>

dhātryaṃ janeti | puṣpanakṣatra amalaphalacūrṇaṃ sauvīrāṃjana cūrṇaṃ ca ekatra 
kṛtvā yadā śītalena jalena āloḍyapīyate tadā garbhabhayaṃ ṛtubhayaṃ na ca 
bhavati bhartṛ rahitā ca yā nārī garbhāvaṃ ṛtu samayo bhāvaṃ ca vāṃchati ata 
eva taddvayā bhāvādbhaya bhayarahitāraṃḍāyatheṣṭaṃ bhajanaṃ kurvati 
pṛthivyāṃ paryaṭan ||86||

dhātryaṃjana bhavacūrṇe pītvā śītena vāriṇā puṣpe |
garbhartrubhītirahitā vicaratu kāmāturāraṃḍā ||86||

surapatīti | indragopakīṭacūrṇaṃ pānīyena sahayā ṛtu sahitā nārī pibati leḍhi vā 
ṛtu kāle pivatītyarthaḥ | tasyā garbhaṃ ṛtukālaśca dūraṃ procchārite dūre 
bhavati | na bhavata ityarthaḥ | hi yasmādarthaḥ ||87||

sadaleti | yasmin gṛhe pradhānā alaktaka indragopakṛsiḥ kapilāgoghṛtaṃ | 
etaistribhiḥ prasādhito niṣpādito jvalati tatra gṛhe kāmayamānānāṃ 
naranārīṇāṃ varāṃgarbhagona bhavati | liṃgayonyādikaṃ na naśyatītyarthaḥ ||88||

surapatigopakacūrṇaṃ ṛtumallajalena yā pibati |
garbhārśave tu tasyā dūraṃ protsārite hi bhavataḥ ||87||

sadalaktakasuraśopakapilāghṛtasaṃprasādhito dīpaḥ |
prajvalati yatra bhavane varāṃgabhaṃgo na jātu cittatra ||88||

<14a>

śvetārketi | yasmin sthāne śvetārkatūlavartyāśūkaravasayāmajjitayāti śayena 
bhāvitayā dīpaḥ prajvālyate tatra kāmayataḥ puruṣasya samagrāṃ rātriṃ yāvat na 
patati stabdhameva tiṣṭhatītyarthaḥ ||82||

bṛhatīti | kaṃkaṭārikā śvetasarṣapa kuṣṭhaṃ ugragaṃdhā aśvagaṃdhā 
etāsāṃ cūrṇaṃ pānīyena akṣacūrṇī kṛtairliṃgaṃ punaḥ punarlepitaṃ marditaṃ 
ca san hayasyeva ghoṭakasyeva bhavatītyarthaḥ ||90||

śvetārkatūlavartyā varāhamedaḥ pradigdhayā dīpaḥ |
stabdhaṃ puruṣa varāṃgaṃ dhārati ca śarvarī śakalaṃ ||89||

bṛhatīsitasiddhārtha vyādhivacāturagagaṃdhayāmahitaṃ |
ebhiḥ pralepitaṃ san puruṣa varāṃgaṃ hayasyeva ||90||

ghṛteti | ājye mākṣikaṃ tilatailaṃ kaṃṭakārikā phalaṃ sevālaṃ svayaṃ guptā 
tāmre prakṣipya saptadināni yāvat tatrasthāpya tato liṃgasya lepanaṃ mardanaṃ ca 
kāryaṃ liṃgavṛddhirbhavati ||91||

sutamiti | karaṃjaphalaṃkorayitvā madhye pāradaṃ prakṣepyaṃ paścāt sūtaṃ 
karaṃjaphala madhyagataṃ tathā śvetasārapuṃkhā tasyā mūle etau dvāvapi mukhe 
nikṣipya yadā surataṃ kriyate tadā puruṣechayā yāvat tāvadvīrya staṃbho bhavati | 
yadā mokṣa iṣyate tadā etau dvāvapi carvayitvā gilyaṃte tadā bīja mokṣo bhavati ||
92||

gomaya jīrṇaṃ cīrṇaṃ bhakṣimanaṃtaraṃ jīrṇaṃ yutena niḥsṛtaṃ 
yadvadarāsthivadarakulīyakastaṃ sachidraṃ 

<14b>

kṛtvā dhārakīṭa hṛdayena saha yuktaṃ kṛtvā rāsapucchake savarakena 
etaddvayaṃ baddhvā puruṣasya kaṭi taṭe baddhe tatpuruṣasya staṃbho bhavati ||92||

ghṛtamadhu yukta taila bṛhatī phalaśūkaramātmaguptā ca || 
ebhirvarāṃgavṛddhiḥ saptadinaṃ tāmrabhāṃḍa uparyuṣitaiḥ ||91||

sūtaṃ karaṃjaphalayuktaḥ sitavāṇapuṃkhitāyā mūlaṃ |
vadanavivarāṃtarasthaṃ staṃbhayati nijecchayā bījaṃ ||92||

ṣaḍviṃddhiti | ṣaṭbiṃdubhramaraḥ kīṭaviśeṣaḥ tasya yad dehajaṃ cūrṇaṃ 
kharamaṃjaryā dīrghaśākhāyāḥ śiphāmūlaṃ tasya cūrṇaṃ arka tūlena vartiḥ 
pūrvokta cūrṇadvaya sahitaṃ kṛtvā yasya gehasya madhye tadā dīpaḥ prajvālyate 
tadgṛhamadhye kāmayamānānāṃ puṃsāṃ bījastaṃbho bhavati ||93||

ājamiti | chājaladugdhaṃ kṣoharidugdhaṃ goghṛtaṃ etat tṛtīyamekatra kṛtvā 
pādatalalepena sakalāṃ rātriṃ kāmayamānānāṃ puṃsāṃ retaḥ stambho bhavati ||
94||

iti śukrastaṃbhanaṃ ||

ṣaḍbiṃdudehacūrṇaiḥ kharamaṃjaryāḥ śiphāmūlaiḥ ||
divasakaratūlavartyādīpaśukrarodhakaḥ puṃsāṃ ||93||

ājaṃvajrī kṣīraṃ (* *?) ghṛtaṃ caraṇa yugalepena | 
staṃbhayati puruṣabījaṃ yogoyaṃ yāminīṃ sakalaṃ ||94||

<15a>

sārdramiti | yasyā nāryāgūthaṃsārddhaṃ aśuṣkaṃ vṛścika kaṃṭakena 
viddhaṃ kṛtya(?) bhūmigatrāyāṃ nikṣipya uparidhūlyāli ruṃdhyate yāvat 
tāvat tasyārāryāyā yoni śūlaṃ bhavati taduddhṛteśaṃ mokṣaḥ ||95||

kuṣṭheti saptadināni yāvat kṛṣṇasarpamukhe guṃjāparivasati athavā 
kṛṣṇasarpamukhe saptadināni yāvad gīlikā parivasati paścāt tata ākṛṣya 
śatroḥ khāne pāne pradattā sati kuṣṭhaṃ karoti paṃcāṃgapiyāla vṛkṣakvāthe 
aṣṭāvaśeṣe pītaḥ sa kuṣṭhaṃ nivartate | trīṇi dināni yāvat kvāthaḥ peyaḥ ||96||

sārdraṃ kṣitiraṃdhra strī varco vṛścikālasaṃbaddhaṃ || 
ghoraṃ varāṃga duḥkhaṃ visṛjati yāvat taduddhṛteśaṃ ||95||

kuṣṭhamarātau visṛjati saptadinaṃ bhujaṃgavadanaparyuṣitā ||
guṃjātha bhavanagojā yāvat kvāthaṃ pimālagana pibet ||96||

sakṛdaṃteti | kākarudhireṇa kākapakṣalekhanyā kākapicche yasya nāma likhitvā 
tadīya gūthamadhye prakṣipyate gūthenaiva koṭāriśaghate sa kāka 
samūhairniraṃtaraṃ bhakṣyate uddhṛte mokṣaḥ ||97||

atraivārthe dvitīya prayogamāha | droṇaketi | droṇakaḥ kṛṣṇakākastasya hṛdaya 
raktena āmravṛkṣapatre yasya nāma vinyasya upari upari tadgūthena chādyate sa 
kākairniraṃtaraṃ bhakṣyate uddhṛte mokṣaḥ ||98||

<15b>

sakṛdaṃtaṃ nikṣiptaṃ dvija hṛdaya kṣataja patra saṃlikhitaṃ | 
yannāma dvijasaṃghāḥ khādaṃti niraṃtaramiha ||97||

droṇaka hṛdayarūdhireṇa ca cūtadale yasya nāma vinyaste || 
tadvarcāṃtarnihitaṃ kākaiḥ saṃbhakṣyate sāpi ||98||

atha gohanajyāvanaṃ | goṣaddvārīti | gokuladvāre kuṃbhe kṛkalā saṃprāṇi 
viśeṣaṃ kṣiptvā nikhanyate bhūmau upari dhūlyā sthāpya tena yathā sthitaṃ 
kuṃbhaṃ yathā gāvo nirgama praveśaṃ kurvaṃti ullaṃghayaṃti | tadā goṣṭhe 
gāvaḥ suptā iva mūrchitā iva viśeṣaṇa hanyamānā api svasthonyattottiṣṭhaṃti 
suptā iva tiṣṭhaṃti yāvadasau kuṃbhastasmānna bāhye ākṛṣyate ākṛṣṭe tu 
gāvaḥ nidrā rahitā yatheṣṭhaṃ saṃcaraṃtītyarthaḥ ||99||

goṣadvāri nikhanitakalaśagakṛkalā saṃlaṃghanādrāvaḥ ||
saptāvihanyamānā api nottiṣṭhaṃtyanuddhṛte tasmin ||99||

atha garbha staṃbha mokṣādhikāraḥ ||

mallaketi | yasyā nāryāḥ prasavaṃtyāḥ garbhastaṃbhaṃ kartuṃ niṣpādyate tasyāḥ 
sarāve huḍavidakṣarāṇi likhitvā tannāma vidarbhitāni kriyaṃte | tato nāryā 
tatkṣaṇā devagarbhastaṃbho bhavati | ayaṃ yogaḥ siddha ityasyārthasya 
jñānārthaṃ sthāne graṃthakāraḥ siddhagrahaṇaṃ karoti | mallakaṃ śarāvaṃ 
prasavaṃ (*?) yāvat tanulikhitaṃ tāvat tasyāḥ prasavo na bhavati | uddhṛte 
tu dhaute mokṣaḥ ||100|| 

atha dīpanirvāṇaṃ || kolaṣkāseti | āmrakośādyattailaṃ tena yosau dīpaḥ 
pracaṇḍepi vātena bādhyatena bādhyate niścala evāvatiṣṭhate | ata eva mahāratna 
dīpa iva ||101||

<16a>

mallaka likhito huḍavit prasavavatnyāḥ staṃbhanaṃ krotyuccaiḥ ||
garbhasya sapadināryāḥ staṃbhanāryāstannāma vidarbhiteḥ siddhaḥ ||100||

kokkāsamaśāmnatailadīpaḥ prajvalati pravapeti pracaṃṇḍepi ||
marutini prakaṃpaḥ sphuranmahāratnadīpa iva ||101||

raviśalabhagodhāvarco manaḥśilā tathā pathyā |
vṛścika viṣaṃ vinaśyaṃtirbhidaṃti daṃśasya lepena ||102||

atha vṛścikaviṣāpahāraḥ | arkakīṭakagṛhagodhikāviṣṭhā manaḥśilā harītakī 
ebhiroṣadhairjalena vartitaiḥ vṛścikadaṃśasya lepaḥ kāryaḥ vṛścika viṣaṃ 
nāśaṃyāti ||102||

dīpeti | palāśavṛkṣabījāni sūkṣmacūrṇaṃ kṛtvā arkakṣīreṇa 
ekaviṃśativāraṃ yāvad bhāvayed daṃśādapi vṛścika viṣaṃ nāśaṃyāti ||
103||

uttareti | uttarasyāṃdiśi yāni dāḍimī vṛkṣamūlāni gatāni gomāṃsaṃ etau 
cūrṇapitvā jalena guṭikā kāryā | anayā guṭikayā vṛścikadaṃśe spṛṣṭe 
daṃśādapi vṛścika viṣaṃ yāti anyasmin puruṣe dṛṣṭe tatra viṣaṃ prasarpati | 
atraiveyaṃ guṭikā devairapi atrārthe praśaṃsitā || 104||

dīpagrasādivākarasya brahmatarorbhāvitairmudgabījaiḥ | 
guṭikā kṛtā prayuktā vṛścikaviṣamāśusaṃharati ||103||

uttaradāḍimamūlairgopisitasamaistaccūrṇitā guṭikā | 
tridaśairapistuteyaṃ vṛścikaviṣadaṃśakramaṇe ||104||

<16b>

aṃkuleti aṃkulatailaṃ aṃkulamūlaṃ dāḍimamūlaṃ ca dāḍimakasya tailaṃ 
jaṃbumūlaṃ jaṃbu tailaṃ ca madhuṣāḍ | etaissamāṃśai guṭikāṃ kārayet sā 
guṭikā vṛścika viṣaṃ saṃkrāmayati sthānāt sthānāṃtaraṃ rayatītyarthaḥ ||104||

atha jalastaṃbhanaṃ ||

stabdha bījacūrṇena votharicūrṇena araṇya sthāna bhasmamiśreṇa śarīraṃ vilipya 
yadā megho varṣati tadā tasya pānīyaṃ śarīre nalagati tena pānīyena karburaṃ na 
kriyatena hyāvyate ityarthaḥ ||106||

aṃkulaṃ tailamūlaṃ dāḍima jaṃbuśca mūla tailena ||
madhuśarkarā samāṃśairvṛścikasaṃkrāmaṇī guṭikā ||105||

bhasma sahitena vigrahaṃ viguḍāstabdha bījacūrṇena ||
jaladharadhārāpātaiḥ paryaṭinaṃ karburaṃ kriyate ||106||

sarjaraseti | sarjarasalohakārarasau prasiddhau śvetārka puṣparasaḥ ebhiḥ paṭoliptaḥ 
san paścāt tasya paṭasyopari pānīyaṃ kṣipyate tatpānīyaṃ paṭenalagati | jalena 
sicyamānopi sannārdro na bhavatītyarthaḥ | etat prakaṭaṃ samastalokānāṃ ||107||

iti jalastambhādhikāraḥ ||

<17a>

athādṛśīkaraṇaṃ ||

harīti | yadyasya ṭīkātruṭiḥ ||

puracāṃguliriti | puraṃ guggulu cāṃgulī vaṃśalocanā bodhavṛkṣaḥ śavaṇikā 
tasya tvak tasyā rasaḥ āpastairaka bhraṣṭataiḥ paṭotyaktaḥ sikta paṭo daitya 
devagaṃdharvairapi na dṛśyate sādhakaḥ || 

sārdramiti paṭa viśeṣaṇaṃ ||109||

sarjasilohakārarasaliptomaṃdārakusumasalilaiśca ||
na bhavati susicyamānaḥ salile nārdraḥ paṭaḥ prakaṭaḥ ||107||

haritaru mūlarasāktairālekhyaṃ varṇakaiḥ paṭe likhitaṃ ||
śuṣkaṃ na dṛśyate taddaśyaṃ cāṃbhobhirāśikiṃ ||108||

puracāṃguli kṛtadhūpodhitarurasena cābhyaktaḥ ||
asurasurakinnarairapi na dṛśyate saṃsthitaḥ paṭaḥ sārdraṃ ||109||

dineti | bhujagārirmayūraḥ saptadināni nirāhārī kṛtvā paścādaṣṭame dine 
prāpte taṃ mayūraṃ manaḥśilāṃ haritālaṃ ca bhakṣayet | punastadviṣṭhāgrāhyā 
| tayā taddravyaṃ liptaṃ tadeva hasta madhya prāptamapi na kopi paśyati | 
adṛṣṭaṃ bhavatītyarthaḥ ||110||

tridineti | triṇidināni anāhāro yosau giri kacchapakṛkalāsastena pūrvaṃ cīrṇa 
bhakṣitamanaṃtaraṃ jīrṇaviṣṭhā tvamāpādite yaddharitālaṃ tena vāmakaratala 
madhyalepādā bharaṇānyākarṣati | talipta hastena ābharaṇāni gṛhṇaṃn kenāpi 
na dṛśyate ||111||

<17b>

dinasaptakaṃ vidhāryastāla śilāhārako bhujamāriḥ ||
tadgraṃthena dravya viliptaṃ karatala sthitamapi na dṛśyate ||110||

tridinoṣita girikachapa cīrṇaṃ ca tālapādāya ||
tena karagarbhalepātvā bharaṇānyā kṣipevāmān ||111||

bījamiti | pāradaḥ viṣaṃ eraṃḍabījaṃ sarpamāṃsaṃ aṃkolabījāṃgakuṭamucyate | 
vānarāsthīni etairekatra piṣitairhastatalaṃ pralipya tena pratimā devādīnā 
spṛśyate tataḥ pratimā kṛṣṭirbhavati ||112||

jīveti | viṣaṃ pārijāta puṣpaṃ tālakaṃ sarpapuchaṃ ebhiraṃ kolataila yuktaiḥ 
piṣṭairhastatalalepāt śaṃkhaśuktyādīnāmākṛṣṭirbhavati ||113||

bījaṃ viṣamāruṣkara bhujabhava godhikāṃga kūṭaiḥ ||
śākhā mṛgāsti yuktaiḥ pratimākarṣo bhavatyebhiḥ ||113||

bījaharā pārijātakatālairhālāhalasya pucchena || 
aṃkolatailayuktairākarṣo bhavati śaṃkhaśuktīnāṃ ||113||

kacchapeti | kachapasya jīvaviśeṣasya mastakaṃ caraṇaṃ ca indragopaḥ 
etairoṣadhaiḥ pakvatailāni nārīṇāṃ kuca lepāt kucāpahāraṃ kurvaṃti ||114||

girīti | girikarṇikā prasiddhā | indragopāśca śatapādikā sahasra caraṇoka vṛkṣaḥ 
etāni ekatra kṛtvā cūrṇaṃ bhagakṣataṃ saṃkocayati || anyānyapi vraṇāni anena 
cūrṇena rohaṃti | ata eva asaureṇu rājaścūrṇarājaḥ ||115||

kachapamastaka caraṇaiḥ surendragopaiśca pakvatailāni || lalanā kuca praṇāśaṃ 
pralepanātśaṃ prakurvati ||114||

<18a>

girikarṇikendra gopakaśatāṃhrikākhyā sa hastacaraṇāśca |
iti janitareṇurājovarāṃgaraṃdrānyā nyāpi prarohati ||115||

lalaneti | vicalanulalanāśīlayan gośṛṃga adhogataṃ tallabdha gośṛṃgaṃ tasya 
yosau rajaścūrṇaṃte navarāṃgalepānnārī puruṣāṇāṃ gamyā sevanīyā na bhavati 
| tathā ūrddhagataṃ sthānaṃ yat gośṛṃgaṃ tallepādvarāṃgaṃ pūrvāṃ 
prakṛti bhajāti puruṣāṇāṃ abhigamanīyā ityarthaḥ | etena nārī varāṃga saṃkoca 
vikāśayuktairati varāṃgaṃ ||117||

prameti | dvimukho yosau sarpastasya raktena raṃjitaṃ sūtraṃ yā ullaṃghayati 
tasyānāryā | garbha vivarādrakta pravāho vigalaparamati ||118||

lalanā na bhavati gamyā vicarat gogavalareṇurati lepāt ||
ūrddhagaviṣāṇa lepāt prayāṃti cūrṇāt tathā prakṛtiṃ ||116||

pramadāyāṃ laṃghayati dvimukhādi kṣatajalaṃjitaṃ śubhraṃ | pravalitavarāṃga 
kuhare kṣayaṃ karākṣataniddharistasyāḥ ||117||

mahiṣeti | mūlaṃ skaṃdhaṃ patraṃ puṣpaṃ phalaṃ etāni paṃcāgāni dhattūrasya 
paṃcāṃgasya cūrṇaṃ paṃcadaśabhāgāḥ ṣoḍaśamo bhāgo vatsanāgaviṣasya 
etānyekatra cūrṇayitvā mahiṣarudhirapradigdhaḥ ekaviṃśati vārān yāvat 
mahiṣarudhireṇa bhāvayitvā saṃśoṣya chāyāyāṃ dhūpaḥ kriyate rātrau 
dhūpadhūpanātu puruṣasya sarvāpi ceṣṭā praṇaśyatītyarthaḥ | rātri 
grahaṇādrātrāvevāsau dhūpaḥ puruṣāṇāṃ haro divase tvat kiṃcit 

<18b>

(ūnclear)

<19a>

puṣpe yavairiti || śastra bhinnasya śūlaprotasya puruṣasya kapāle puṣpanakṣatre 
yāvat dhānyaviśeṣān vāpayitvā eḍikādugdhena sicyate taistathāpi vātaistathā 
siktaiśca yāni phalāni yāvadrūpāṇi nicyete tāni gṛhītvā mālākāryā sā 
mālāśirasi baddhā sati puruṣaṃ sādhakaṃ nigūhati adṛśaṃ karotītyarthaḥ ||
120||

mṛdvāraṇeti | mṛnmaṛttikā tayotpādito yosau hastī tasya yatkuṃbhasthalaṃ 
tatra yadraṃdhraṃ chidraṃ tatra gato nikṣipto'sau picumaṃdasarjaniryāsaḥ | 
etadvṛkṣa dvayarasaḥ sa ādityaraśmi tāpānmadakalalīlāṃ vidhārayati ||123||

pralipyeti | rāsabhājarāyunāmarīca pippalīśuṃṭhī cūrṇa yuktena vāmapādaṃ 
pralipyate na vṛkṣastāḍitaḥ san samastāni puṣpāṇi phalāni ca muṃcati tatra 
vṛkṣeṇa kiṃcidapi puṣpaphalādiradvitītyarthaḥ ||124||

puṣperyavaiḥ kapāle nikṣiptaiḥ śastraśulabhinnasya ||
āvikaṃpayobhiṣaktaistatphalamālānaraṃ nigūhati ||122||

mṛdvāraṇa kuṃbhasthalaraṃdhragapi cumaṃdasarjaniryāsaḥ |
dinakarakiraṇasparśānmadakalalīlāṃ vidhārayati ||123||

prakṣipyavāmapādaṃ trikaṭukayuktena rāsabhījarayā ||
sakalakusumavarṣāse tāḍito muṃcati drumastena ||124||

spṛṣṭa iti | śunīgarbhaśayyā marīca pippalī śuṃṭhī cūrṇasahitayā lipto yosau 
hastastena vṛkṣaḥ spṛṣṭaḥ san phalapuṣpasamūhaṃ muṃcati kāma vṛkṣa iva 
kalpavṛkṣa iva | sa yathā prārthita eva sarvāṇi phalapuṣpādīni yāni ca 
kāryāṇyarthayati tathā ayamapi hasta spṛṣṭamātrepi sarvāṇi phalakusumāni 
prayachaṃtītyarthaḥ ||121||

<19b>

dineti | arkakṣīreṇābhyakte mahākuṃbhe ghaṭe arkakṣīreṇa punaḥ punarbhāvitena 
śuṣke ghṛtapalenaikena saha gavyakṣīraṃ uttamaṃ prakṣiptaṃ san yāvat 
tatkṣīraṃ uttamatvaṃ na parityajatīti tāvat sarvaṃ tacca ghaṭastaṃ 
gavyaghṛtasadṛśaṃ pratibhāsate viniveśitaṃ tatra kuṃbhe sthāpitaṃ ||126||

spṛṣṭaḥ karakamalena trikaṭukasaramājarāyu liptena ||
muṃcati phalakusuma cayaṃ vṛkṣaḥ khalukāma vṛkṣeva ||125||

dinakara dugdhābhyakte kuṃbhe'smin ghṛtapalaikasaṃyukte ||
kṣīraṃ yāvaccottamaṃ tāvad viniveśitaṃ sarpiḥ ||126||

pratyagreti | pratyagro navo yosau ghaṭastasya yosau garbho madhyaṃtamarka kṣīreṇa 
punarbhāvayitvā śoṣayitvā tādṛśe ghaṭe pānīyaṃ prakṣipta mātrameva 
pradhānaṃ takraṃ bhavati pānīyaṃ go rasavat pratibhāsate ityarthaḥ ||127||

asakṛditi | tathā te naiva pūrvokta prakāreṇa na ve ghaṭe arkakṣīreṇa punarbhāvite 
ityarthaḥ | tatra evaṃ vidhe ghaṭe kapitthaphalamadhyasaṃyukte śuṣkaṃ yatkapittha 
phalasya madhyaṃgiralakṣaṇasamete ityarthaḥ ||129||

pratyagrakuṃbhagarbhaṃ bhānukṣīreṇa bhāvayed vahuśaḥ ||
prakṣiptamātramaṃbho bhavati hi tasmin bhavaṃ takraṃ ||127||

asakṛtkṣīrābhyakte tathātra śuṣka kapittha phalamadhyasaṃyukte ||
cūrṇitaḥ prayuktastakraṃ dadhibhāvamānayati ||128||

<20a>

upeti | uparatā mṛtāste ca te śuṣkāścate matsyāmīnāsteṣāṃ āruṣkaro 
bhallāṭakastasya phalaṃ tadrasena viliptaṃ pāśvapradeśe yeṣāṃ evaṃ 
kṛtānāṃ teṣāṃ śītalajale prakṣiptānāṃ tatkṣaṇā devajīvaṃ bhavati mṛtā api 
matsyā anena vidhinā kṛtena punarjīvaṃtītyarthaḥ ||129||

puruṣamiti | mṛtapuruṣapārśvajo yosau śaṃkuḥ kīlakaḥ sadīrghagrīvāsthi 
raṃdhre uṣṭrahā ucchidre kṣipto naranāryoḥ saṃbhogādhi rūḍhayoryoni 
nivaṃdhaṃ kurute | yadaivatau suratādhi rūḍhau bhavatastadaiva sa kīlakastatra 
chidre cennikṣipyate tadā puruṣasya liṃgayoni madhyānnaniḥsaratītyarthaḥ | śaṃko 
asthiraṃdhra madhyādā kṛṣṭenaranāryorapi cihna baṃdho vimukto 
bhavatītyarthaḥ ||130||

acirācchīghraṃ ||

uparataśaṃkuśuṣkāṇāmaruṣkarasavilipta pārśvānāṃ |
śītāṃbhasi matsyānāṃ bhavati punarjīvitaṃ nimeṣāt ||129||

puruṣaṃ gaṇayoracirāddīrghagrīvāsthi raṃdhre nikṣiptaḥ ||
kurute varāṃgabaṃdhaṃ rati samaye mṛtapuruṣayājośaṃkuḥ ||130||

sariditi | saritsamudragāminī nadī tasyāḥ pūrvaparātaṭa mṛttikā surate 
āleḍhilagnau saktau yau sāramayyau kakkurī kukkurau tayoromāṇi etāni pūrvoktayā 
mṛdā saha guṭikā kṛtvā tāṃ yaṃ puruṣamuddiśya aṃkolataila madhye 
kṣipyate sa puruṣo yasmin nāsane pīṭhe pāṭikāyāṃ mastake hastini aśve nare rathe 
ca ityādike anyasminnapi yatra kutra citsthitau bhavati tatra eva kīlako bhavati |

<20b>

tadāsanādikaṃ yat yutena saha vilagnamuttiṣṭhatītyarthaḥ || 
guṭikāyāṃ tailādā kṛṣṭāyāṃ āsanādi muktaṃ bhavati ||131||

saridubhaya taṭāṃta mṛdāsaramātursārameya romāṇi ||
leḍhī lagnau sarvāsana vaṃdhakarī guṭikaiṣāṃ kaulatailayuktā ||131|| śrī || śrī || 
śrī ||

nayaneti | nayanayoryugaṃ nayana yugaṃ tena raśmi madhyagasya bhakārasya 
caṃdramaṇḍalābhyāsāt puruṣāṇāṃ sādhanāṃ aṃtarmadhye sthitaṃ 
jyotirvahalāṃdha kāreti prakaṭī bhavati evaṃ vidhākṣara dhyānāt sādhakasya 
samasta jñeyadārtha prakāśakaṃ tejaḥ samunmīlatītyarthaḥ ||132||

nayanayugaraśmī madhyakāra candramaṇḍalābhyāsāt ||
āvirbhavati nārāyaṇāmaṃtarjyotistathāṃdha kārepi ||132||

śāstramupasaṃharannāha | gurumukhāditi | gurūṇāṃ yanmukhaṃ vaktra kamalaṃ 
tato yadabhimataṃ parijñānaṃ gurubhiḥ suprasannairyanmamāgre ekāṃte 
upadiṣṭaṃ taṃ mayā jñātaṃ tanmadhye anubhava padyaṃ prāpya 
anubhūyetyarthaḥ | tanmadhyādyat samyaganubhavamārge samāyātaṃ tasya 
madhyāt kiṃcidulyatamaṃ svalpa mātraṃmiha āścaryayogaratnāvalī śāstraṃ 
dṛṣṭaṃ prathitaṃ mukhāvabodhamāyāṃ vaṃdhe(? * * *?) 
yeti anena ācārya śrīnāgārjunena viracitā ātmānaṃ nidarśayati ||133||

<21a>

gurumukhādi gataṃ śāstrāṃtaraṃ ca yan mayāṃ jñātaṃ ||
anubhavaṃ mamāgre nītvā tanmadhyāt kiṃcidiha dṛṣṭaṃ ||133||

āścaryeti | āścaryāṇyeva ratnāni teṣāṃ mālā paddhatiḥ sā nāgārjunācāryeṇa 
nirmitā guṃphitā | kathaṃ bhūtā | anubhava prasiddhā anubhavena siddhā | tathā 
saha kalābhiścatuḥṣaṣṭhi saṃkhyā lakṣaṇāni vartate ye te ca janāśca teṣāṃ tu 
hṛdayaṃmaṃtaḥ karaṇaṃ tasya dayitā vallabhā āścaryayogamālā sutrataḥ 
samarthitā sūtradvāreṇa catvāriṃśadadhikaṃ śataikena āścaryāṇāṃ samāptā 
jayati sarvotkarṣena varśaṃte ityanena śāstrasyāśīrvādaṃ dadātyācāryaḥ ||134||

[āścaryayogamālānāgārjunaviracitānubhavaprasiddhā |
sakalajane hṛdayadayitā samarthitā sūtrato jayati] ||134||

<22>

ātmasmaraṇāyeti | yadaśuddhamidaṃ nirūpitamācāryāstat kṣamyatāṃ prasādaṃ 
me kṛtvā viśodhyatāṃ yat konaskhalati pramādani vahena || 
śrīnṛpavikramasamaye dvādaśabhirnapa ṣaḍadhikairhyeṣāracitā guṇākareṇa 
śvetāmbabhikṣaṇa jayati ||135||

[iti śrīśvetāmbarapaṇḍitaguṇākaraviracitā āścaryayogamālālaghuvṛtti 
samāptābhūt] ||

ātmasmaraṇāya mayā vikrītā nāgārjunapraṇīteyaṃ |
āścaryayogamālā agre tava vṛddhaṭīkāvaḥ ||135||

śrīkumbheśvaro vijayatetarāṃ || śrī || 

[iti āścaryayogamālā samāptā] rat ||

likhitāścaryayogamālā sthale kumbheśvarasya vai || 
gaṇeśabhaṭṭaputreṇa bhavānīśaṅkareṇa ca || 1 ||

chalena gṛhīte ya vai na deyā yasya kasyacit || 
durmilā bhavati kṣmāyāṃ na yātu śaṭhahaṃstake harāmamīdi(?) ||1|| 

abhyamitryaḥ papuḥ śabdaśāstrādhikārījanānvīkṣya sarvāndayāśīlavāhni ||22||

sarvāmāṃgalya yaṃ kucya (* * * * *?) śasvāṃ caritrī 
pareṣāṃ kathāyāṃ 

<23>

upākarmaṇi (*?) tsaryo pretaśrāddhe tathaiva ca || 
candrasūryagrahe caiva rajo doṣo na vidyate ||1||

kauśikī vāgmatī gaṃgā gaṇḍakyo dharmasaṃbhavāḥ |
śatyābhadrālakānandā rajodoṣai na lipyate ||2||

na duṣyate rajodoṣaiḥ sā nadī rudravaktra (*?) ||
vāgmatī bhāratīmānyā tryahādūrddhāccakarkaṭāt ||3||

siṃhakarkaṭayormadhye sarvānadyorajaḥsvalāḥ ||
